Subject: [PATCH] refactor(desktop): the store's known session owner lives in
 known-session-owner.ts

use-session-actions/utils.ts is over the 2000-line target and may only
shrink. The sync owner ladder (tile route, unique hint, tagged row, proven
runtime event) that resolveSessionOwner and the stored-session probe both
read moves to known-session-owner.ts as knownSessionRpcOwner, with
knownExactOwnerRoute beside it, so utils.ts calls it once instead of
spelling the ladder twice. Nothing else changes.
